;*******************************************************************
; SYMST0.A99 -- M38h first half of resident Small-C symbol storage
;
; The 15-character symbol contract needs 5175 bytes:
;   25 locals * 23 + 200 globals * 23 = 5175.
;
; A single 5175-byte BSS object would make one R99 module exceed the
; 4KB module ceiling.  Keep the store contiguous but split it across
; two explicitly adjacent resident modules.  This first chunk is even
; sized so SYMST1 begins immediately after it with no alignment hole.
;*******************************************************************

        ENT     symtab
symtab:
        BSS     3000
        END
